{
 "about": "Rules whose effect is USE_FILTER_CONDITION, NOT_APPLICABLE, or empty. The upload's golden says whether the PAP stores such a rule. A rule whose condition holds, alone in its policy: under DENY_UNLESS_PERMIT true only if it allows; under PERMIT_UNLESS_DENY false only if it denies. With an rsqlPredicate the filter tells a deny term (DENY, or the negation under PERMIT_UNLESS_DENY), no term, and an allow term (the predicate).",
 "resourceTypePrefix": "PARITY_SUITE_R29ST_",
